      "content": "thanks for the advice. i'll try the ibuprofen and the tea. the pain is still pretty gnarly though and it's actually starting to feel less like a sharp poke and more like a heavy, tearing sensation that's moving into my back. and the pulsing... it's not really stopping, it's actually getting way more noticeable. like i can actually feel it thumping against my skin. i'm also feeling kind of dizzy and lightheaded all of a sudden. is that just the pain or maybe a side effect of the ibuprofen?",
